<title>UK: DNIB sets 150 mln guilder fixed/reverse FRN.</title>
<headline>DNIB sets 150 mln guilder fixed/reverse FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DE NATIONALE INVESTERINGSBANK NV</p>
<p> AMT   150 MLN DFL    COUPON   **8.25	MATURITY    19.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE  FIX/REV FRN    ISS PRICE  101.125   PAY DATE    19.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.50     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	**PAYABLE ANNUALLY UNTIL YEAR FOUR, THEN 16 PCT LESS</p>
<p>		2 X 6M AIBOR PAYABLE SEMI-ANNUALLY</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    AMST	DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.625     SELL CONC  0.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
